# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# --mode trajectory — Rust-only trajectory walk with clone-replay
# determinism check. Catches non-deterministic Rust state mutation
# (same seed -> different fingerprint sequence) and clone divergence.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------


